[
 {
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 0.0
 },
 {
  "text": "There was a time you could walk from India to Sri Lanka.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 2.019,
  "chunk": 0,
  "pause_after": 0.343
 },
 {
  "text": "No boat.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 2.362,
  "end": 2.788,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "No ticket.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 2.788,
  "end": 3.213,
  "chunk": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Just dry land.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 3.213,
  "end": 3.851,
  "chunk": 1,
  "pause_after": 0.318
 },
 {
  "text": "Then the sea rose, and what's left today is a thin chain of limestone shoals, about forty-eight kilometres long.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 4.169,
  "end": 8.71,
  "chunk": 2,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "Some old accounts say people could still cross it on foot until around five hundred years ago.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 8.923,
  "end": 13.267,
  "chunk": 3,
  "pause_after": 0.208
 },
 {
  "text": "That's tradition, not a measurement.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 13.476,
  "end": 14.899,
  "chunk": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "Now imagine it never broke.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 14.899,
  "end": 16.321,
  "chunk": 4,
  "pause_after": 1.167
 },
 {
  "text": "Imagine it still stood, from Rameswaram all the way to Sri Lanka.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 17.489,
  "end": 20.6,
  "chunk": 5,
  "pause_after": 0.293
 },
 {
  "text": "What would that change?",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 20.893,
  "end": 21.64,
  "chunk": 6,
  "pause_after": 0.525
 },
 {
  "text": "And could we use it tomorrow?",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 22.165,
  "end": 23.165,
  "chunk": 7,
  "pause_after": 0.625
 },
 {
  "text": "Let's walk it.",
  "section": "THE HOOK",
  "start": 23.79,
  "end": 24.473,
  "chunk": 8,
  "pause_after": 0.758
 },
 {
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 25.231
 },
 {
  "text": "First, what exactly are we talking about?",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 25.231,
  "end": 26.966,
  "chunk": 9,
  "pause_after": 0.695
 },
 {
  "text": "Off the coast of Rameswaram, in Tamil Nadu, a ridge of shallow stone runs towards Mannar Island in Sri Lanka.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 27.661,
  "end": 34.01,
  "chunk": 10,
  "pause_after": 0.389
 },
 {
  "text": "In places it sits barely a metre under the surface.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 34.399,
  "end": 36.673,
  "chunk": 11,
  "pause_after": 0.232
 },
 {
  "text": "India's space agency mapped it in 2024, and almost all of it lies below the waterline.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 36.905,
  "end": 41.071,
  "chunk": 12,
  "pause_after": 0.268
 },
 {
  "text": "For millions of people, this is Ram Setu.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 41.339,
  "end": 42.796,
  "chunk": 13,
  "pause_after": 0.24
 },
 {
  "text": "In the Ramayana, Lord Ram's army builds a bridge across the sea to reach Lanka.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 43.035,
  "end": 46.302,
  "chunk": 14,
  "pause_after": 0.341
 },
 {
  "text": "On world maps, it's Adam's Bridge.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 46.643,
  "end": 47.809,
  "chunk": 15,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "Geologists describe natural limestone shoals, shaped as sea levels changed.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 48.129,
  "end": 52.191,
  "chunk": 16,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "This video won't try to settle that.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 52.404,
  "end": 53.94,
  "chunk": 17,
  "pause_after": 0.35
 },
 {
  "text": "Faith and science have been in that conversation for a long time.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 54.289,
  "end": 57.072,
  "chunk": 18,
  "pause_after": 0.269
 },
 {
  "text": "We're asking something else.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 57.341,
  "end": 58.428,
  "chunk": 19,
  "pause_after": 0.502
 },
 {
  "text": "What if a continuous causeway still stood here, wide enough for people, trucks and trains?",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 58.93,
  "end": 62.834,
  "chunk": 20,
  "pause_after": 0.659
 },
 {
  "text": "The first thing it would change isn't the land.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 63.493,
  "end": 64.94,
  "chunk": 21
 },
 {
  "text": "It's the sea.",
  "section": "WHAT IT IS",
  "start": 64.94,
  "end": 65.422,
  "chunk": 21,
  "pause_after": 0.916
 },
 {
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 66.338
 },
 {
  "text": "On one side, the Palk Bay.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 66.338,
  "end": 67.274,
  "chunk": 22,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "On the other, the Gulf of Mannar.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 67.59,
  "end": 68.648,
  "chunk": 23,
  "pause_after": 0.36
 },
 {
  "text": "Today, water slips between them across the shallows.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 69.008,
  "end": 71.284,
  "chunk": 24,
  "pause_after": 0.416
 },
 {
  "text": "Close that gap, and the currents have to find a new way around.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 71.7,
  "end": 74.359,
  "chunk": 25,
  "pause_after": 0.292
 },
 {
  "text": "Ships would feel it too.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 74.651,
  "end": 75.494,
  "chunk": 26,
  "pause_after": 0.233
 },
 {
  "text": "The strait is so shallow that large ships can't cross it.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 75.727,
  "end": 77.526,
  "chunk": 27,
  "pause_after": 0.209
 },
 {
  "text": "They sail all the way around Sri Lanka instead.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 77.734,
  "end": 79.375,
  "chunk": 28,
  "pause_after": 0.368
 },
 {
  "text": "India has argued about this for decades.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 79.743,
  "end": 81.247,
  "chunk": 29,
  "pause_after": 0.393
 },
 {
  "text": "A project called Sethusamudram planned a deep channel through the shallows, to cut up to 424 nautical miles from some voyages.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 81.64,
  "end": 87.738,
  "chunk": 30,
  "pause_after": 0.353
 },
 {
  "text": "Court challenges stopped it in 2007.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 88.091,
  "end": 90.234,
  "chunk": 31,
  "pause_after": 0.328
 },
 {
  "text": "Reports say only about a fifth of the dredging at the bridge itself was ever done.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 90.561,
  "end": 94.351,
  "chunk": 32,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "So here's the strange part.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 94.735,
  "end": 95.623,
  "chunk": 33,
  "pause_after": 0.304
 },
 {
  "text": "A causeway wouldn't make ship routes worse.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 95.928,
  "end": 97.398,
  "chunk": 34
 },
 {
  "text": "They already go around.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 97.398,
  "end": 98.239,
  "chunk": 34,
  "pause_after": 0.565
 },
 {
  "text": "But it would shut the door on the one thing everyone has wanted for a century.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 98.804,
  "end": 101.4,
  "chunk": 35,
  "pause_after": 0.342
 },
 {
  "text": "A shortcut.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 101.742,
  "end": 102.159,
  "chunk": 36
 },
 {
  "text": "Unless the causeway could open.",
  "section": "THE SEA",
  "start": 102.159,
  "end": 103.202,
  "chunk": 36,
  "pause_after": 0.836
 },
 {
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 104.038
 },
 {
  "text": "And that's not a fantasy.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 104.038,
  "end": 105.096,
  "chunk": 37,
  "pause_after": 0.285
 },
 {
  "text": "India just built one, a few kilometres away.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 105.381,
  "end": 107.507,
  "chunk": 38,
  "pause_after": 0.205
 },
 {
  "text": "At Pamban, the railway reaches Rameswaram across the water.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 107.712,
  "end": 111.202,
  "chunk": 39
 },
 {
  "text": "The old bridge opened in 1914.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 111.202,
  "end": 113.528,
  "chunk": 39,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "Its middle could swing open for ships.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 113.765,
  "end": 115.018,
  "chunk": 40,
  "pause_after": 0.213
 },
 {
  "text": "In 2022, rust forced it to close.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 115.231,
  "end": 116.965,
  "chunk": 41,
  "pause_after": 0.228
 },
 {
  "text": "In April 2025, a new one opened.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 117.193,
  "end": 118.951,
  "chunk": 42,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "Its centre span, seventy-two metres long, lifts seventeen metres into the air so ships can pass.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 119.237,
  "end": 123.132,
  "chunk": 43,
  "pause_after": 0.218
 },
 {
  "text": "So the sea problem has an answer.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 123.35,
  "end": 124.741,
  "chunk": 44,
  "pause_after": 0.321
 },
 {
  "text": "A road that opens when the ocean asks.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 125.062,
  "end": 126.714,
  "chunk": 45,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "The harder problem is the human one.",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 127.094,
  "end": 128.925,
  "chunk": 46
 },
 {
  "text": "Who would actually cross?",
  "section": "THE LIFTING BRIDGE",
  "start": 128.925,
  "end": 129.972,
  "chunk": 46,
  "pause_after": 1.066
 },
 {
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 131.037
 },
 {
  "text": "Picture the first morning.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 131.037,
  "end": 132.319,
  "chunk": 47
 },
 {
  "text": "Pilgrims arriving at Rameswaram.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 132.319,
  "end": 133.601,
  "chunk": 47
 },
 {
  "text": "Trucks lining up.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 133.601,
  "end": 134.563,
  "chunk": 47,
  "pause_after": 0.279
 },
 {
  "text": "A railway pointing south-east, towards a different country.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 134.842,
  "end": 136.922,
  "chunk": 48
 },
 {
  "text": "And then, a border.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 136.922,
  "end": 137.963,
  "chunk": 48,
  "pause_after": 0.411
 },
 {
  "text": "Customs.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 138.373,
  "end": 138.64,
  "chunk": 49
 },
 {
  "text": "Immigration.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 138.64,
  "end": 138.907,
  "chunk": 49
 },
 {
  "text": "Two sets of rules.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 138.907,
  "end": 139.975,
  "chunk": 49,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "The queue wouldn't end at the bridge.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 140.214,
  "end": 141.422,
  "chunk": 50
 },
 {
  "text": "It would begin there.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 141.422,
  "end": 142.112,
  "chunk": 50,
  "pause_after": 0.251
 },
 {
  "text": "A bridge doesn't remove a border.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 142.364,
  "end": 143.718,
  "chunk": 51,
  "pause_after": 0.33
 },
 {
  "text": "It moves the queue onto the road.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 144.047,
  "end": 145.306,
  "chunk": 52,
  "pause_after": 0.201
 },
 {
  "text": "Today, you cross by air, or by ferry.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 145.507,
  "end": 147.121,
  "chunk": 53,
  "pause_after": 0.281
 },
 {
  "text": "The ferry from Nagapattinam to Jaffna covers about a hundred and eleven kilometres in around three and a half hours.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 147.402,
  "end": 152.21,
  "chunk": 54,
  "pause_after": 0.788
 },
 {
  "text": "So would a road be faster?",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 152.998,
  "end": 153.982,
  "chunk": 55,
  "pause_after": 0.603
 },
 {
  "text": "For you, probably not.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 154.586,
  "end": 155.627,
  "chunk": 56,
  "pause_after": 0.542
 },
 {
  "text": "A flight from Chennai to Colombo takes roughly an hour and a half.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 156.168,
  "end": 158.749,
  "chunk": 57,
  "pause_after": 0.398
 },
 {
  "text": "Driving the causeway route would take most of a day.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 159.147,
  "end": 161.597,
  "chunk": 58
 },
 {
  "text": "For cargo, it's a different story.",
  "section": "DAY ONE",
  "start": 161.597,
  "end": 163.067,
  "chunk": 58,
  "pause_after": 0.895
 },
 {
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 163.961
 },
 {
  "text": "Trucks and trains don't care about airports.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 163.961,
  "end": 165.858,
  "chunk": 59,
  "pause_after": 0.286
 },
 {
  "text": "A road could carry goods from Tamil Nadu's factories to Sri Lanka's ports without ever being lifted onto a ship.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 166.145,
  "end": 170.496,
  "chunk": 60,
  "pause_after": 0.223
 },
 {
  "text": "Fewer handovers.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 170.719,
  "end": 171.317,
  "chunk": 61
 },
 {
  "text": "Fewer delays.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 171.317,
  "end": 171.915,
  "chunk": 61,
  "pause_after": 0.214
 },
 {
  "text": "Possibly lower costs for heavy, bulky goods.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 172.129,
  "end": 174.069,
  "chunk": 62
 },
 {
  "text": "Possibly.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 174.069,
  "end": 174.346,
  "chunk": 62,
  "pause_after": 0.246
 },
 {
  "text": "Because both countries would have to agree who gains what.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 174.592,
  "end": 176.387,
  "chunk": 63,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "A bigger neighbour, a smaller island, and one road between them.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 176.661,
  "end": 178.959,
  "chunk": 64,
  "pause_after": 0.2
 },
 {
  "text": "Every link between countries has a quiet condition.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 179.159,
  "end": 181.578,
  "chunk": 65
 },
 {
  "text": "Trust.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 181.578,
  "end": 181.88,
  "chunk": 65,
  "pause_after": 0.222
 },
 {
  "text": "And there's one more thing a causeway would have to ask permission from.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 182.103,
  "end": 184.903,
  "chunk": 66,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "The water itself.",
  "section": "FREIGHT",
  "start": 185.108,
  "end": 185.938,
  "chunk": 67,
  "pause_after": 1.016
 },
 {
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 186.954
 },
 {
  "text": "The Gulf of Mannar Marine National Park has been recorded with about three thousand six hundred species of plants and animals.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 186.954,
  "end": 191.99,
  "chunk": 68,
  "pause_after": 0.255
 },
 {
  "text": "More than a hundred kinds of coral.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 192.246,
  "end": 193.858,
  "chunk": 69
 },
 {
  "text": "Seagrass meadows.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 193.858,
  "end": 194.318,
  "chunk": 69,
  "pause_after": 0.28
 },
 {
  "text": "And dugongs, among the most endangered marine mammals on India's east coast.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 194.598,
  "end": 197.505,
  "chunk": 70,
  "pause_after": 0.387
 },
 {
  "text": "In shallow seas, sand moves quickly.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 197.891,
  "end": 199.131,
  "chunk": 71,
  "pause_after": 0.303
 },
 {
  "text": "A solid wall across it would change where the sand goes, and where the water flows.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 199.434,
  "end": 203.151,
  "chunk": 72,
  "pause_after": 0.219
 },
 {
  "text": "So a modern crossing would almost certainly stand on pillars, not on a solid bank.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 203.37,
  "end": 207.459,
  "chunk": 73,
  "pause_after": 0.275
 },
 {
  "text": "The sea keeps breathing.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 207.735,
  "end": 208.769,
  "chunk": 74
 },
 {
  "text": "The animals keep moving.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 208.769,
  "end": 209.804,
  "chunk": 74,
  "pause_after": 0.382
 },
 {
  "text": "Which brings us to the people who live off that water.",
  "section": "THE WATER",
  "start": 210.186,
  "end": 212.027,
  "chunk": 75,
  "pause_after": 0.7
 },
 {
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 212.726
 },
 {
  "text": "Fishermen from both countries share these waters.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 212.726,
  "end": 214.336,
  "chunk": 76,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "Arrests of fishermen who cross the maritime line are a recurring tension between India and Sri Lanka.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 214.652,
  "end": 218.813,
  "chunk": 77,
  "pause_after": 0.319
 },
 {
  "text": "A land link wouldn't end that.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 219.133,
  "end": 220.162,
  "chunk": 78,
  "pause_after": 0.316
 },
 {
  "text": "It would put a fixed structure right in the middle of it.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 220.478,
  "end": 222.316,
  "chunk": 79,
  "pause_after": 0.39
 },
 {
  "text": "Someone would have to decide who guards which side, who inspects which boat, and how the fishing fleets pass underneath.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 222.706,
  "end": 226.966,
  "chunk": 80,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "A bridge is stone and steel.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 227.224,
  "end": 228.635,
  "chunk": 81
 },
 {
  "text": "A border is decisions.",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 228.635,
  "end": 229.576,
  "chunk": 81,
  "pause_after": 0.237
 },
 {
  "text": "So, could we build all this today?",
  "section": "THE FISHERMEN",
  "start": 229.813,
  "end": 231.042,
  "chunk": 82,
  "pause_after": 0.954
 },
 {
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 231.996
 },
 {
  "text": "Technically, yes.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 231.996,
  "end": 232.845,
  "chunk": 83,
  "pause_after": 0.479
 },
 {
  "text": "China's Hong Kong-Zhuhai-Macau link is fifty-five kilometres long, longer than this whole chain.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 233.324,
  "end": 237.33,
  "chunk": 84,
  "pause_after": 0.379
 },
 {
  "text": "About thirty of those kilometres cross open sea, with a tunnel for ships to pass over.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 237.708,
  "end": 241.108,
  "chunk": 85,
  "pause_after": 0.388
 },
 {
  "text": "It took nine years and about twenty billion dollars.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 241.496,
  "end": 243.724,
  "chunk": 86,
  "pause_after": 0.38
 },
 {
  "text": "Across shallow shoals, the engineering might be simpler.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 244.104,
  "end": 246.405,
  "chunk": 87,
  "pause_after": 0.25
 },
 {
  "text": "The storms, the sand and the sea would still be hard.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 246.655,
  "end": 248.693,
  "chunk": 88,
  "pause_after": 0.278
 },
 {
  "text": "Even if the old stones stood, nobody would drive on them.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 248.972,
  "end": 251.114,
  "chunk": 89,
  "pause_after": 0.206
 },
 {
  "text": "We'd build a modern road along the same path.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 251.32,
  "end": 253.047,
  "chunk": 90
 },
 {
  "text": "And the idea isn't new.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 253.047,
  "end": 254.006,
  "chunk": 90,
  "pause_after": 0.257
 },
 {
  "text": "In 2023, the leaders of India and Sri Lanka agreed to study a land link, along with an oil pipeline.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 254.263,
  "end": 258.737,
  "chunk": 91,
  "pause_after": 0.41
 },
 {
  "text": "As far as I can find, nothing has been built.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 259.148,
  "end": 261.132,
  "chunk": 92
 },
 {
  "text": "Which leaves the real question.",
  "section": "CAN WE BUILD IT?",
  "start": 261.132,
  "end": 262.124,
  "chunk": 92,
  "pause_after": 0.849
 },
 {
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 262.973
 },
 {
  "text": "So what changes if the bridge never broke?",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 262.973,
  "end": 264.869,
  "chunk": 93,
  "pause_after": 0.691
 },
 {
  "text": "The sea splits in two.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 265.56,
  "end": 266.609,
  "chunk": 94,
  "pause_after": 0.249
 },
 {
  "text": "Ships still go around, or through a lifting span.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 266.858,
  "end": 269.083,
  "chunk": 95
 },
 {
  "text": "A border turns into a road.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 269.083,
  "end": 270.567,
  "chunk": 95,
  "pause_after": 0.243
 },
 {
  "text": "Trucks beat planes on cargo, but never on speed.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 270.81,
  "end": 272.632,
  "chunk": 96,
  "pause_after": 0.337
 },
 {
  "text": "And the quiet water underneath has to be protected.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 272.969,
  "end": 274.699,
  "chunk": 97,
  "pause_after": 0.385
 },
 {
  "text": "For some people, it would be a place of faith you could walk.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 275.083,
  "end": 277.058,
  "chunk": 98,
  "pause_after": 0.344
 },
 {
  "text": "For others, a piece of infrastructure.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 277.402,
  "end": 278.751,
  "chunk": 99
 },
 {
  "text": "For many, both.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 278.751,
  "end": 279.425,
  "chunk": 99,
  "pause_after": 0.219
 },
 {
  "text": "A connection is never only stone and steel.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 279.644,
  "end": 281.484,
  "chunk": 100,
  "pause_after": 0.4
 },
 {
  "text": "It's a choice, made again and again, by everyone who crosses it.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 281.885,
  "end": 284.605,
  "chunk": 101,
  "pause_after": 0.365
 },
 {
  "text": "There was a time you could walk from India to Sri Lanka.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 284.97,
  "end": 287.185,
  "chunk": 102,
  "pause_after": 0.239
 },
 {
  "text": "The stones are still there.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 287.424,
  "end": 288.222,
  "chunk": 103,
  "pause_after": 1.233
 },
 {
  "text": "The question was never whether we could build the way.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 289.455,
  "end": 291.273,
  "chunk": 104
 },
 {
  "text": "It's whether we'd agree on how.",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 291.273,
  "end": 292.364,
  "chunk": 104,
  "pause_after": 0.414
 },
 {
  "text": "If you could walk it tomorrow, would you?",
  "section": "THE REAL ANSWER",
  "start": 292.778,
  "end": 294.057,
  "chunk": 105,
  "pause_after": 2.0
 }
]